WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:03.480
DAY 114

00:04.230 --> 00:08.030
It happened after we passed
through mountains...

00:08.030 --> 00:09.990
and reach a hill area.

00:10.620 --> 00:11.740
Are you okay?

00:11.740 --> 00:14.990
It just suddenly came...

00:14.990 --> 00:19.380
I felt like this would happen
since two days ago, but...

00:21.040 --> 00:26.010
This time, the alchemist and blacksmith
are about to give birth.

00:26.800 --> 00:30.260
I'll stop the skeleton centipede
near a place that has water.

00:30.680 --> 00:31.840
O-Okay!

00:31.840 --> 00:33.510
And we'll build a camp there...!

00:34.010 --> 00:37.520
Just a little more!
Hang in there!

00:37.930 --> 00:39.810
Thus, this is the second time.

00:39.810 --> 00:43.020
But I already know what to do.

02:24.000 --> 02:30.050
BLACKSMITH, EMERY FURLATT
ALCHEMIST, SPINEL FEAN

02:30.050 --> 02:32.490
Emery, Spinel.

02:33.090 --> 02:36.010
I'm happy to meet your babies.

02:36.590 --> 02:38.890
Thank you so much.

02:40.180 --> 02:43.510
High orc male babies
that Emery's gave birth

02:43.510 --> 02:44.550
is Oniwaka.

02:45.900 --> 02:49.900
And for Spinel's female human baby,

02:49.900 --> 02:51.400
I named her Nicola.

02:51.400 --> 02:55.280
Wow, he's twice bigger than her.

02:55.280 --> 02:59.410
Princess! They're still newborns,
so please don't play tricks on them...

02:59.410 --> 03:01.290
I-I know that!

03:01.990 --> 03:05.330
The two new mothers are in good condition
even after giving birth earlier,

03:05.330 --> 03:07.790
so I decided to move
the skeleton centipede again.

03:08.630 --> 03:11.460
By tomorrow noon,
we should reach our last transit,

03:11.460 --> 03:13.300
Purgatory.

03:13.800 --> 03:16.300
DAY 115

03:28.150 --> 03:29.480
Is this okay?

03:30.110 --> 03:32.230
You look good on it, Princess.

03:32.230 --> 03:34.590
Do we really need to disguise?

03:35.530 --> 03:38.950
This place is already close
to the Royal Capital of Oswell.

03:38.950 --> 03:41.620
If they knew our identities,
it would make an uproar.

03:41.620 --> 03:43.160
Well, I guess you have a point.

03:44.120 --> 03:47.090
For the mothers,
you can take a rest at the inn,

03:47.500 --> 03:52.250
while the others go to the adventurer guild
to gather information.

03:52.250 --> 03:54.090
I wanna go!

03:54.090 --> 03:55.510
Us too?

03:56.420 --> 03:58.760
You can take a nap too, you know?

03:59.470 --> 04:01.350
Tch, fine.

04:06.100 --> 04:10.100
Hey, this guild has
a free training room too!

04:10.100 --> 04:11.150
Huh...

04:11.150 --> 04:13.150
You look really strong.

04:13.150 --> 04:16.650
If you're up for it,
would you like to spar with us?

04:17.900 --> 04:20.410
Well, let's see...

04:21.200 --> 04:25.200
I can fight all of them,
but it feels somewhat lacking.

04:25.660 --> 04:28.250
Oh, then how about this?

04:28.250 --> 04:30.750
All of you can spar with them.

04:30.750 --> 04:31.670
Huh?!

04:31.670 --> 04:33.190
All right, everyone.

04:33.190 --> 04:34.590
If you win against them,

04:34.590 --> 04:38.170
I'll give you 5 silver plates
as a prize!

04:38.170 --> 04:39.840
Wait, stop deciding for...

04:39.840 --> 04:41.300
Man, that's sure a prize!

04:41.300 --> 04:42.910
Let's start right now!

04:49.810 --> 04:52.400
I'm glad everyone is having fun.

04:52.400 --> 04:55.400
Seems like Dhami also actually
wants to participate,

04:55.400 --> 04:57.690
but she can't even seem
to hold back at all,

04:57.690 --> 04:59.320
so she's just observing them.

05:00.320 --> 05:02.410
I-I can't take it anymore...

05:02.410 --> 05:03.700
So strong...

05:03.700 --> 05:06.590
Even I can't believe it too...

05:07.040 --> 05:11.410
But we can actually fight this good...

05:12.540 --> 05:15.040
Oh come on, that's not
something to cry about.

05:15.040 --> 05:18.340
We decided to grow
stronger together, didn't we?

05:18.340 --> 05:20.220
This is just the beginning!

05:20.220 --> 05:25.260
Thus, for you, the strongest
among mercenaries,

05:25.260 --> 05:27.150
I'm welcoming you to Para Bellum.

05:28.640 --> 05:32.900
After that, I, together
with Dhami and the Redhead,

05:32.900 --> 05:36.770
went shopping
to replenish our supplies.

05:37.190 --> 05:38.780
This is...

05:38.780 --> 05:41.530
You really have a good eye, sir.

05:41.870 --> 05:44.850
It's a pretty rare magic item...

05:44.850 --> 05:47.030
that allows you to print
any scenery you see...

05:47.030 --> 05:51.040
from the peeking hole directly
into the paper inside of it.

05:52.460 --> 05:53.670
I'll buy it!

05:53.670 --> 05:58.550
Yes, this tool was called a "camera"
back in my former world.

05:59.050 --> 06:03.180
Naturally, after I got back to the inn,
I took a lot of pictures of my babies.

06:05.800 --> 06:07.850
If we leave this place tomorrow,

06:07.850 --> 06:10.270
it'll take a few days
to reach our final destination,

06:10.270 --> 06:11.810
the Royal Capital Oswell.

06:12.390 --> 06:15.810
What kind of enemy is
waiting for us there?

06:16.830 --> 06:18.070
Now that I think about it,

06:18.530 --> 06:23.820
I haven't contacted the other members
recently because of the childbirth fuss.

06:24.950 --> 06:27.990
First, the third group
led by Bloodsato.

06:28.580 --> 06:32.750
Oh, Ogrou?
It's going smoothly over here.

06:32.750 --> 06:36.330
Spellsei bought a mountain of spellbooks.

06:36.330 --> 06:39.630
Wait, I didn't remember giving you
that much money...

06:40.840 --> 06:42.920
Don't worry about it.

06:42.920 --> 06:48.470
We're using a high-value elf as bait
to capture bandits and kidnappers,

06:48.470 --> 06:51.130
that's why we don't have
to worry about our travel expenses.

06:51.130 --> 06:54.480
Wha... Fine, but don't get
too bold, okay?

06:55.270 --> 06:58.980
Next, the fifth group led by Dodome.

06:58.980 --> 07:01.980
How's the situation there, Dodome?

07:02.690 --> 07:06.030
We're gathering information
while moving around to different places.

07:06.030 --> 07:09.490
I see, thank you for your hard work.

07:09.490 --> 07:12.870
You can take a rest
and play somewhere sometimes, you know?

07:12.870 --> 07:15.500
I'm so happy!

07:15.500 --> 07:16.830
- What? You got something to say?

07:16.830 --> 07:17.920
- After that,
- What? You got something to say?

07:17.920 --> 07:19.420
- I tried to contact the fourth group but...
- Yes, a lot.

07:19.420 --> 07:21.130
- I tried to contact the fourth group but...
- Like I said, going right is better.

07:21.130 --> 07:23.710
We don't have a leader, so...

07:23.710 --> 07:28.300
We're always fighting,
even over where to go.

07:28.300 --> 07:30.720
Well, I see the problem.

07:31.410 --> 07:33.850
Those new recruits after this
will be disappointed...

07:33.850 --> 07:36.350
knowing that goblins
who are lower than them...

07:36.350 --> 07:38.850
have a much better situation.

07:38.850 --> 07:42.230
This is still what I expected, but...

07:43.570 --> 07:46.240
Fine, guess it can't be helped.

07:46.240 --> 07:48.990
For now, your leader is...

07:48.990 --> 07:52.490
I second that. As you said, Big Bro Ogrou,
the one who can be a leader is―

07:52.490 --> 07:54.830
you, Hobrin.

07:54.830 --> 07:56.000
Okay...

07:56.000 --> 07:58.250
Huh?!!

07:58.250 --> 07:59.500
Me?!

07:59.870 --> 08:02.100
With that said,
keep up your good work.

08:02.100 --> 08:04.060
Try to not fight
with each other, all right?

08:04.060 --> 08:06.510
Wait a minute, Big Bro Ogrou!

08:07.510 --> 08:12.350
All that's left is the second group,
Ogrekichi and others, huh...

08:12.350 --> 08:16.270
But the view I got from earcuffs is...

08:23.820 --> 08:26.130
I... am...

08:28.950 --> 08:31.030
Ogrou? What's wrong?

08:33.780 --> 08:35.290
I am...

08:35.630 --> 08:37.010
Dead...?

08:41.290 --> 08:43.790
DAY 116

08:47.550 --> 08:49.550
What? Going the other way?

08:49.550 --> 08:55.680
Yeah, I'm just curious about the things
with my friends in Maze City Griphos.

08:56.130 --> 08:58.770
But, to think Ogrou is killed...

08:58.770 --> 09:01.100
It's called a foresight dream, right?

09:01.100 --> 09:04.690
I heard that some people
have that ability too.

09:05.270 --> 09:07.740
Please don't say such
an ominous thing!

09:08.280 --> 09:11.450
Nevertheless, I need to go there
and check it with my own eyes.

09:14.410 --> 09:17.790
How long does it take
from here to Griphos?

09:17.790 --> 09:19.960
If we're moving fast,
around 2 days I assume.

09:19.960 --> 09:24.000
Therefore, we may be a bit late
in reaching Royal Capital...

09:24.000 --> 09:25.090
I allow it.

09:25.090 --> 09:26.460
Princess?

09:27.130 --> 09:30.510
We're moving way faster
than our original plan, am I right?

09:30.510 --> 09:33.800
A detour for 2 days
won't cause any problems at all.

09:33.800 --> 09:35.470
That's true, but...

09:36.890 --> 09:41.190
With that said, we're headed
to Maze City, Griphos!

09:44.980 --> 09:46.950
Thank you, Princess.

09:51.490 --> 09:54.490
DAY 117

09:55.450 --> 10:01.250
Our travel went smoothly, and we'll
reach Griphos tomorrow as planned.

10:01.250 --> 10:03.500
Papa.

10:04.500 --> 10:07.000
Papa is moved!

10:07.450 --> 10:09.760
Do your best too, Oniwaka!

10:09.760 --> 10:13.010
This one isn't even walking at all.

10:13.010 --> 10:16.600
It's because she's human just like us.

10:17.010 --> 10:19.140
Just like us and princess,

10:19.140 --> 10:22.770
it takes around one year
to even begin walking.

10:25.770 --> 10:27.230
I don't remember that!

10:27.230 --> 10:28.510
Well, me too.

10:36.700 --> 10:39.540
You're still carrying that?

10:45.740 --> 10:49.710
A necklace you made
when we were still goblins...

10:50.630 --> 10:54.470
It was just four months ago,
but it feels nostalgic for some reason.

10:55.550 --> 10:57.260
Ever since I got this,

10:57.260 --> 10:59.680
there's already a lot going on, right?

11:00.390 --> 11:03.270
Fighting humans as mercenaries,

11:03.270 --> 11:06.190
and now we're bodyguarding
a human princess.

11:07.350 --> 11:11.330
You're also evolving and gradually
becoming manlier too.

11:12.650 --> 11:17.070
Yet why I'm still a dhampir?

11:18.700 --> 11:19.910
Dhami...

11:21.700 --> 11:26.210
Even I still don't have a baby
from the one I love the most...

11:26.210 --> 11:28.420
Hear me, Dhami.

11:29.040 --> 11:32.250
As long as my desire
to become stronger still exists,

11:32.250 --> 11:34.590
I won't leave my friends alone.

11:35.470 --> 11:36.500
Ogrou...

11:37.510 --> 11:40.100
Besides, whether you have kids or not,

11:40.100 --> 11:42.540
our feelings won't change!

11:43.100 --> 11:44.300
Isn't that right?!

11:48.400 --> 11:49.890
You're right...

11:51.360 --> 11:53.860
DAY 118

11:54.820 --> 11:59.870
We arrived at Maze City Griphos
the next day at noon.

12:00.740 --> 12:04.870
Probably, Ogrekichi and others
are inside the dungeon, but...

12:05.190 --> 12:06.580
This is not what we agreed to!

12:06.580 --> 12:09.880
I didn't know that there was
a stupidly big boss down there!

12:10.630 --> 12:12.130
Hey, hold on right there!

12:12.130 --> 12:15.510
You better give up!
This dungeon is messed up!

12:15.510 --> 12:19.390
That minotaurus...
Not even a lord can beat it!

12:20.140 --> 12:22.390
Minotaurus?

12:23.430 --> 12:25.890
Your friends?

12:26.350 --> 12:28.140
That's... what I assume.

12:28.140 --> 12:31.440
Th-That's... because we decided
that it's dangerous,

12:31.440 --> 12:36.650
Three parties went there
to exterminate it just a few hours ago...

12:39.820 --> 12:42.130
This is the dungeon entrance...

12:50.120 --> 12:51.670
This guy...

13:06.810 --> 13:10.940
You have become smaller since
the last time we saw each other,

13:10.940 --> 13:12.440
Ogrou.

13:13.690 --> 13:17.190
You're the one growing bigger, Ogrekichi.

13:17.190 --> 13:19.110
Heave-ho!

13:19.700 --> 13:21.200
Is he dead?

13:21.200 --> 13:24.120
Nah, he's just passed out.

13:24.700 --> 13:25.990
Leaving that aside,

13:25.990 --> 13:29.540
can you tell me the situation regarding
the one who's about to kill me?

13:29.540 --> 13:31.460
Ah, about that...

13:32.330 --> 13:35.210
This is what I heard from Earthe.

13:36.170 --> 13:38.020
In the deepest part of the dungeon,

13:38.020 --> 13:40.720
a rare monster called
Mind Mirror has appeared.

13:41.130 --> 13:45.100
This monster is said to copy the strongest
opponent that the person facing it...

13:45.100 --> 13:47.580
holds dearly in his or her heart.

13:48.850 --> 13:49.730
Ogrou?!

13:54.560 --> 13:58.730
Ogrekichi was completely beaten up
by this monster, but...

13:58.730 --> 14:01.740
THE "DEATH FATE" OGREKICHI IS ABOUT TO RECEIVE
IS CANCELED DUE TO OGROU'S "FATE PLUNDER"

14:01.740 --> 14:04.240
IF HE RECEIVES GOD'S BLESSING IN A CERTAIN
PERIOD OF TIME, "DEATH FATE" CAN BE AVOIDED

14:11.000 --> 14:15.750
At that time, Ogrekichi made
choices of his own accord.

14:15.750 --> 14:17.250
OGREKICHI HAS RECEIVED
BLESSINGS OF THE DEMIGOD OF LIGHTNING

14:17.250 --> 14:19.250
OGREKICHI HAS SUCCESSFULLY
AVOIDED "DEATH FATE"

14:22.130 --> 14:26.680
What I saw back then was this view.

14:27.750 --> 14:29.690
So, that form...

14:30.140 --> 14:32.870
MINOTAUR: NOVEL SPECIES, EARTH LORD VARIANT
Minotaur: Novel Species,

14:32.870 --> 14:34.520
MINOTAUR: NOVEL SPECIES, EARTH LORD VARIANT
or something like that.

14:34.520 --> 14:38.650
MINOTAUR: NOVEL SPECIES, EARTH LORD VARIANT
And I became Earth Lord Variant.

14:38.650 --> 14:40.400
I see.

14:40.400 --> 14:43.400
But I'm glad now
that I know the situation.

14:43.900 --> 14:46.800
For the time being,
we'll stay in this town for a night,

14:46.800 --> 14:48.910
so how about we talk
about this with every...

14:48.910 --> 14:50.240
Ogrou.

14:50.910 --> 14:52.430
Before that,

14:53.080 --> 14:55.890
have a match with me.

14:56.920 --> 14:59.590
You haven't changed at all, Ogrekichi.

14:59.590 --> 15:01.420
I knew you would say that!

15:07.850 --> 15:09.850
What is going on here?

15:10.210 --> 15:14.480
That guy, as big as a mountain,
is Ogrou's friend, right?

15:14.480 --> 15:16.100
Why are they fighting each other?

15:16.100 --> 15:18.190
Yeah, they are friends.

15:18.190 --> 15:19.730
Just like me.

15:19.730 --> 15:21.620
Ever since he was born into this world...

15:22.730 --> 15:26.820
That's why we always
wish to have power...

15:26.820 --> 15:28.740
stronger than our friend.

15:34.610 --> 15:38.670
I guess it's been a month
since our last match,

15:38.670 --> 15:42.250
yet you've already grown this strong.

15:42.870 --> 15:48.220
The axe and shield I sent back then
were enhanced according to the user, huh...

15:48.930 --> 15:51.970
I have fought a lot of
strong ones in this maze,

15:51.970 --> 15:54.770
and a lot of our race too.

15:55.480 --> 15:58.010
The reason I polished
my strength and technique...

15:58.730 --> 16:01.770
...is to defeat you, Ogrou!

16:01.770 --> 16:04.780
It's because I want us to be equal!

16:04.780 --> 16:06.170
Equal?

16:07.280 --> 16:08.590
Yeah.

16:08.590 --> 16:11.240
We'll be equal with the same strength,

16:11.240 --> 16:14.490
and walk together as true friends.

16:14.490 --> 16:16.540
O-Okay...

16:16.940 --> 16:18.670
Man, it's no use.

16:18.670 --> 16:22.040
Why am I always weak
against honest guys like him?

16:22.630 --> 16:24.170
Ready whenever you are.

16:25.260 --> 16:26.550
But,

16:27.630 --> 16:30.070
this time I'll win!

16:30.680 --> 16:33.180
That's the spirit!

16:33.890 --> 16:37.680
First, you have to give it
all you've got against me!

16:49.570 --> 16:52.620
That axe...
Such sturdiness and weight.

16:53.200 --> 16:56.700
Nobody else will be able to lift that.

16:57.870 --> 16:59.790
What's wrong?!

17:00.290 --> 17:01.290
He's fast!

17:01.290 --> 17:02.790
I'll parry it!

17:08.170 --> 17:09.880
A-Awesome!

17:09.880 --> 17:12.550
I've never seen this kind of fight before!

17:12.550 --> 17:14.680
Yeah, it's really awesome.

17:15.930 --> 17:19.270
Due to Blessing, Ogrekichi now...

17:19.270 --> 17:22.590
can control fire and
lightning simultaneously.

17:24.440 --> 17:28.280
For lightning attacks, I can ignore them
with Complete Lightning Resistance,

17:28.280 --> 17:31.450
but I can't resist fire
with my current ability.

17:31.450 --> 17:35.030
All you can do is run, huh, Ogrou?

17:35.450 --> 17:39.500
This is my assumption,
but in terms of fire control,

17:39.500 --> 17:40.960
he's above me.

17:41.460 --> 17:44.210
Then I'll come for you!

17:44.210 --> 17:46.710
"I want us to be equal."

17:46.710 --> 17:50.970
This is the fruit of
that feeling and desire.

17:50.970 --> 17:54.970
This is the best!
You're the best, Ogrekichi!

17:57.470 --> 17:59.470
All right!

18:00.480 --> 18:03.480
Don't let your guard down!
Not just to your enemy,

18:03.480 --> 18:05.610
but your surroundings too!

18:05.950 --> 18:09.790
Dammit, my training habit
made me throw a piece of advice!

18:12.450 --> 18:16.700
With the Ogrekichi now, his eye structure
won't allow him to look at his back.

18:17.700 --> 18:18.870
Then...

18:30.050 --> 18:31.670
Well, he figured it out!

18:34.510 --> 18:38.760
This illusion is a combined
ability from the shield!

18:41.520 --> 18:45.520
I thought I wouldn't use this
against my friend,

18:45.520 --> 18:46.100
UNREASONABLE VAJRA POWER IS IN USE

18:46.100 --> 18:48.020
UNREASONABLE VAJRA POWER IS IN USE
Unreasonable Vajra Power...

18:48.520 --> 18:52.270
This ability amplifies all of my abilities.

19:17.590 --> 19:21.390
That red light!
It's without a doubt Earth's!

19:21.890 --> 19:24.100
Dance of Thousand Spears!

19:28.110 --> 19:29.360
Have a little more!!

19:30.360 --> 19:32.230
Earth's Dance of Thousand Spears,

19:32.230 --> 19:35.780
furthermore enhancing my ability
of Dance of Thousand Spears!

19:35.780 --> 19:38.160
How will you break out now?!

19:47.370 --> 19:49.270
Dammit, I knew it!

19:49.880 --> 19:51.290
Where is he?!

19:55.380 --> 19:57.840
He used that explosion...

19:57.840 --> 19:59.890
This one is beyond my expectations.

19:59.890 --> 20:00.970
But...

20:02.260 --> 20:04.770
You can't dodge freely in the air!

20:06.390 --> 20:07.890
Is that even allowed?!

20:11.900 --> 20:12.650
However...

20:17.030 --> 20:18.660
Okay, with this...

20:24.490 --> 20:28.040
Y-You dumbass!
Think about your output!

20:33.750 --> 20:34.550
Princess!

20:35.050 --> 20:37.050
What the hell is this?!

20:50.810 --> 20:54.530
You lost to anger
and lost your bearing of power.

20:55.050 --> 21:00.070
Right now, you're thinking it's going to
affect our nearby friends, aren't you?

21:00.510 --> 21:02.720
You controlled the atmosphere instantly,

21:03.200 --> 21:06.120
and unleashed the biggest
barrage of fire and lightning...

21:06.120 --> 21:08.080
right into the middle of this arena.

21:09.500 --> 21:13.880
I'm fine because no matter
the damage, I can heal fast.

21:14.540 --> 21:18.090
But there are humans
among the spectators.

21:21.840 --> 21:24.100
For once,

21:25.930 --> 21:28.350
BLACK DEMON'S EVIL EYES
cool your goddamn head!

21:28.350 --> 21:29.350
DIGNITY OF BLACK DEMON'S MESSENGER

21:31.060 --> 21:33.100
BLACK DEMON ROAR

21:34.560 --> 21:36.610
GIANT'S MALLET, RAGING FIST MEAT CRUSHER

21:44.240 --> 21:47.410
Man... How nostalgic.

21:48.250 --> 21:51.790
Right when I punched him,
the thing that flew inside my head

21:51.790 --> 21:55.750
is the memory of when I gave him
educational training for the first time.

23:30.010 --> 23:39.980
NEXT: RE:START
